{"id":"413852","name":"南瓜银耳蛋羹","author":"沙娅琪琪","authorId":"11047852","desc":"","cover":"images/413852/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"200克"},{"name":"银耳","amount":"50克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1枚"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大枣","amount":"1颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备材料如图。","img":"images/413852/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜去皮去瓤。","img":"images/413852/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将南瓜切小块。","img":"images/413852/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡发的银耳撕成小片。","img":"images/413852/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将银耳、南瓜、冰糖、枸杞、大枣一起放入高压锅中，加入适量清水烧开。上汽后炖20分钟。","img":"images/413852/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烧一锅水，锅底冒小泡就将鸡蛋打入。","img":"images/413852/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小火煮至鸡蛋熟透心。","img":"images/413852/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炖好的银耳如图。","img":"images/413852/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将南瓜银耳汤盛入碗中。","img":"images/413852/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撇去浮末捞出鸡蛋放入碗中。","img":"images/413852/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"美味可口的早餐！","img":"images/413852/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}